The prebuilt binaries shipped with this package are compiled from the PrimJS
(primjs flavor) or quickjs-ng (quickjs flavor) sources plus this project's
own C++ layer, so they contain PrimJS code under the Apache License 2.0
above and QuickJS-derived portions under MIT (LICENSE-quickjs-ng):

  abi/<flavor>/android/<abi>/libfjs*.so
  abi/<flavor>/ohos/arm64-v8a/libfjs*.so and ohos/libs/arm64-v8a/libfjs*.so
  ios/abi/<flavor>/*.xcframework
  macos/abi/<flavor>/*.xcframework

The corresponding sources live in native/ in the project repository
(https://github.com/snice/ufjs); they are not shipped in the published
package because nothing in a consumer build compiles them.
